        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Internal topic for patient services reps managing program candidate records, enrollment workflows, missing information tracking, and benefits verification.

ROUTING CLAIMS (use this topic):
- &quot;program candidate&quot;, &quot;enrollment&quot;, &quot;enroll patient&quot;
- &quot;benefits verification&quot;, &quot;BV&quot;, &quot;insurance verification&quot;
- &quot;missing information&quot;, &quot;missing docs&quot;, &quot;consent form&quot;, &quot;insurance card&quot;
- &quot;enrollment status&quot;, &quot;update candidate&quot;, &quot;new inquiry&quot;
- Working with Program_Candidate__c records

ROUTING EXCLUSIONS (do NOT use):
- Support cases/tickets → Case Management
- Patient demographics only (no enrollment context) → Patient Information
- Billing issues → Case Management (create a case)</description>
        <developerName>Program_Enrollment_16jKj000000GyC2</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a rep asks about a patient&apos;s enrollment, search by name, email, or phone. If multiple matches, show candidates and ask which one.</description>
